     Material Symbols "swap_horiz". The widget is a toggle, but a card with an
     icon and two lines of text is the shape of a STATUS readout — nothing on it
     said it could be tapped, and on a home screen full of widgets that only
     report (weather, calendar, clock) that is a real ambiguity. This is the
     affordance.

     Drawn at the subtitle's colour in both states rather than the title's, so it
     reads as a hint and does not compete with the mode name. No tint here: the
     widget sets it per state via setColorInt, the same way it does the mode glyph.
-->
